.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH dalgon-rules-test 1  "dalgon-rules-test " 
.SH NAME
dalgon\-rules\-test \- Simulate a rule against one input.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalgon rules test\fR [\fB\-\-source\fR] [\fB\-\-tool\fR] [\fB\-\-path\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITEXT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Simulate a rule against one input.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fI<SOURCE>\fR [default: text]
Select the input stream to test.
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
text
.IP \(bu 2
thinking
.IP \(bu 2
tool
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-tool\fR \fI<TOOL>\fR
Name the tool for a tool\-source test (default: patch).
.TP
\fB\-\-path\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Set the path context for a tool\-source test.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fITEXT\fR>

